Short:        the very obsolete memory.h header
Author:       Henning Nielsen Lund
Uploader:     hnl_dk amigaos dk (Henning Nielsen Lund)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     the OS4 SDK
Architecture: generic

memory.h is a very obsolete headerfile that is still used by some software :-(
You should edit the files that use it and exchange memory.h with string.h ... but to be sure that you remember, install this.

Simply copy the content to SDK: and it should work for newlib and clib2.

I hope that you will not need to use this.

Best regards,
Henning Nielsen Lund

